[TEMPLATE.Epilogue]
High command congratulates you and your troops on your victory! Valor and heroism, and the unparalleled performance of your soldiers and officers, helped bring this great victory about! But they would never have succeeded without your command and control, your keen sense of tactics and strategic foresight!

[TEMPLATE.FailureEpilogue]
Your troops were defeated despite their valor and heroism. The enemy proved too strong. However, any bitter defeat is also a good lesson that brings future victory closer. There can be no victory without defeat. Defeated, a good commander only becomes stronger and wiser.

